{
  "udgt": 1,
  "name": "Who Did It",
  "slug": "who-did-it",
  "about": "A browser multiplayer hidden-role game for 4 to 10 players: a static Phaser client and an authoritative Colyseus server, isometric 2.5D in V1, first-person 3D planned for V2, set in the harbour hamlet of HollowMere in autumn 1931.",
